  --taxability: record # optional, enumerated string filter  Specifies if the customer is liable for tax. Possible values are : taxable, exempt.  **Supported operators :** is, is_not, in, not_in  **Example →** *taxability\[is\] = "taxable"*  (e.g. taxable)
