  --auto-close-invoices: record # optional, boolean filter  Override for this customer, the [site-level setting](https://www.chargebee.com/docs/2.0/metered_billing.html#configuring-metered-billing) for auto-closing invoices. Only applicable when auto-closing invoices has been enabled for the site. This attribute is also available at the [subscription level](/docs/api/subscriptions/subscription-object#auto_close_invoices) which takes precedence. Possible values are : *true, false*  **Supported operators :** is  **Example →** *auto_close_invoices\[is\] = "true"*  (e.g. true)
