  --business-entity-id: record # <dfn class="text-muted"><p class="mb-2">optional, string filter</p></dfn> <p class="mb-2">The unique ID of the <a href="/docs/api/business_entities">business entity</a> of this <code class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 font-medium border border-gray-300 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 mx-1 text-sm font-mono whitespace-nowrap">price_variant</code>. <a href="/docs/api/using_business_entity_filters_in_product_catalog_list_apis">Learn more</a> about all the scenarios before using this filter.</p> <span featureId="cb-mbe" isMicro="true"></span> <p class="mb-2"><strong class="font-semibold">Supported operators :</strong> is, is_present</p> <p class="mb-2"><strong class="font-semibold">Example →</strong> <em class="italic">business_entity_id[is_present] = &quot;true&quot;</em></p> (e.g. business_entity_id)
