  --description: string # <p class="mb-2">Description of the item price.</p> <div class="alert alert-info"><p class="mb-2"><strong class="font-semibold">Note</strong>:</p><ul class="list-disc list-outside ml-6 my-4 space-y-2"> <li class="text-base leading-relaxed">The description field supports up to 2000 characters, including HTML tags. The inner text (excluding HTML tags) must not exceed 500 characters. For example: <code class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 font-medium border border-gray-300 rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 mx-1 text-sm font-mono whitespace-nowrap">-   testing -   desc  </code>. Total with tags: 38 characters, inner text: &#x27;testing desc&#x27; (12 characters).</li> <li class="text-base leading-relaxed">If your input includes characters requiring sanitization, such as incomplete HTML tags, the sanitization process may alter the input and increase its length. If the sanitized content exceeds the allowed limit, the request will be rejected.</li> </ul></div>
