  --price-variant-id: string # An immutable unique identifier of a [price variant](/docs/api/price_variants).
  --status: string@status-completer-8 # The status of the item price. \* archived -  The item price is no longer active and cannot be used in new subscriptions or added to existing ones. Existing subscriptions that already have this item price will continue to renew with the item price. \* active -  The item price can be used in subscriptions.
