  --purchased-at: record # optional, timestamp(UTC) in seconds filter  Timestamp (UTC) when the subscription was originally purchased in the respective marketplace (initial purchase). **Supported operators :** after, before  **Example →** *purchased_at\[after\] = "1777559357"*  (e.g. 1777556271)
